		{"id":"05643c8540683573","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n4 /10 06:00\n---\n##### The Players Leave Threshia\n**Expedition**\nThe players set out from Threshia with the Caravan led by Boren Stoutmantle.","x":102,"y":-470,"width":398,"height":270},
		{"id":"5b65cef0356fbce1","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n7 /10 16:00\n\n---\n\n##### PCs arrive at RBO\n\n**Military action**","x":102,"y":-160,"width":398,"height":120},
		{"id":"06e629aa6747ef11","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n11 /10 08:00\n\n---\n\n##### Players Leave Thornfield\n\n**Expedition**\n\nPlayers leave Thornfield bound for Phandalin.","x":102,"y":0,"width":398,"height":80},
		{"id":"f05f234f6940e629","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**  \n12 /10\n\n---\n\n##### Battle with ankhegs\n\n**Military action**","x":102,"y":120,"width":398,"height":120},
		{"id":"dfb536b99fd1ccb0","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n14 /10\n\n---\n\n##### First Night in Phandalin\n\n**Expedition**","x":102,"y":279,"width":398,"height":101},
		{"id":"990c80483e1a74d3","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n15 /10\n\n---\n\n##### Night at the Fountain Near Phandalin\n\n**Celestial / Cosmic**","x":102,"y":414,"width":398,"height":106},
		{"id":"5dc5ba8d53460bb5","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n16 /10\n\n**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n18 /10\n\n---\n\n##### The Battle of Phandalin\n\n**Military action**","x":102,"y":554,"width":398,"height":86},
		{"id":"34944a5d42150166","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n23 /10 900:00\n\n---\n\n##### Back to Thornfield\n\n**Expedition**","x":102,"y":678,"width":398,"height":102},
		{"id":"7b539032d87ce780","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n26 /10\n\n---\n\n##### Leaving Thornfield\n\n**Expedition**\n\nThe players leave Thornfield after a few days rest, helping the survivors of Phandalin, setting off to finish off the blight and kill a dragon.","x":102,"y":813,"width":398,"height":127},
		{"id":"ce30545d85326a33","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n29 /10\n\n---\n\n##### Arrive in the Ruins of Phandalin\n\n**Expedition**\n\nPlayers search the now burned and melted ruins of Phandalin, finding a basement full of climbing equipment and a map, with an x over the entrance to a mine, they decide to go there.","x":102,"y":978,"width":398,"height":102},
		{"id":"01c81f5662d7e4b6","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n3 /11\n\n---\n\n##### Night at the Ruins of a Foresters Camp\n\n**Expedition**\n\nExplored the mine to the north, Ren disappeared, followed by Ali. 2 horses are gone, one dead one missing. Found a diary of a miner. On the way to the swamp.","x":102,"y":1137,"width":398,"height":123},
		{"id":"4841652f473f2276","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n10 /11\n\n---\n\n##### Return to Thornfield\n\n**Expedition**\n\nLeaving from Phandalin after parting from Minkmutt, Slaying the Dragon Gor'Korok and uprooting the Sunless Tree.","x":102,"y":1321,"width":398,"height":119},
		{"id":"36ce63ba56c45574","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n14 /11\n\n---\n\n##### Arrival in Thornfield\n\n**Expedition**\n\nReturning to Thornfield wielding Gor'Korok's skull.","x":102,"y":1498,"width":398,"height":122},
		{"id":"132087d89dc06b52","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n17 /11\n\n---\n\n##### Expedition South\n\n**Expedition**\n\nAAA leaves Thornfield on the way south to investigate the troubles in Hommlet and the Iron Forest.","x":102,"y":1662,"width":398,"height":138},
		{"id":"41d6e24a273de6e6","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n19 /11\n\n---\n\n##### Leaving Hommlet\n\n**Expedition**\n\nAfter selling the Goldfish to the wizard in the tower and investigating some strange activity.. AAA once again ventures south towards the Iron Forest.","x":102,"y":1875,"width":398,"height":125},
		{"id":"84821c47eb004bbc","type":"text","text":"**2998 EAD**\n\n  \n25 /11\n\n---\n\n##### Arrival in Laath Thalas\n\n**Discovery, Exploration**\n\nAfter a harrowing journey through the Iron Wood, where AAA encounter the giants Eznir and Fluag, an ancient tower crawling with undead, and get chased by an elvish scouting party over a bridge swarming with stirges, AAA eventually arrive in the elven cityt of Laath Thalas, home to the Spring Gleam druids.","x":102,"y":2078,"width":398,"height":122},
		{"id":"fd54206787ef161e","type":"text","text":"**2999 EAD**\n\n  \n16 /1\n\n---\n\n##### Vespidans and Formians\n\n**Expedition**\n\nAAA spend several weeks with the Elves, having learned of Aaracokra in service to a race of bee people, AAA travel south once more to investigate.  \nAfter fighting a giant bear attempting to steal the bees' honey, AAA learn of a colony of Formians besieging the Vespidans. Knowing they are usually not so warlike the party approaches and attempts a parlay, when they are taken captive.","x":102,"y":2243,"width":398,"height":137},
		{"id":"6fd7a064494c9164","type":"text","text":"**2999 EAD**\n\n  \n17 /1\n\n---\n\n##### Thornfield becomes Vassal\n\n**Political event**\n\nAAA escape captivity in the formians hive through a portal found outside the queen's chambers. They emerge through a tower holding more than a few undead to find themselves in a Thornfield much different than the way they left it.","x":102,"y":2473,"width":398,"height":127},
		{"id":"73fa68fd9afaf456","type":"text","text":"**2999 EAD**\n\n  \n20 /1\n\n---\n\n##### Triple A join the Cult of the Rift\n\n**Religious event**\n\nTriple A find themselves exploring the undercity of Thornfield. They split up, 2 joining a cult gaining momentum in Thornfield, hoping to gain a better understanding of their operations. The others follow behind. They are joined by Grimtooth Lowblow, to look for an ancient text.","x":102,"y":2659,"width":398,"height":121},
		{"id":"13fa75b664f51b88","type":"text","text":"**2999 EAD**\n\n  \n22 /1\n\n---\n\n##### Trident Valley Expedition\n\n**Expedition**\n\nTriple A leave Thornfield under the control of Threshia Goldenmane and head north to the Arcanite mountains in search of a book, an artifact the Cult of the Rift is searching for.","x":102,"y":2843,"width":398,"height":157},
		{"id":"8e8f85731eb14e31","type":"text","text":"**2999 EAD**\n\n  \n24 /1\n\n---\n\n##### The Underdark\n\n**Disaster / Destruction**\n\nTriple A find themselves on the edges of the underdark after flooding the dungeon they were exploring with Lava. Encountering some escaped slaves from a nearby mine they join forces, go back to the mine and attempt a prison break.","x":102,"y":3081,"width":398,"height":139},
		{"id":"5b9f9fcaec619069","type":"text","text":"**2999 EAD**\n\n  \n27 /1\n\n---\n\n##### Escape Through The Mine\n\n**Military action**\n\nTriple A travel through the underdark, before finding some escaped slaves looking for a way to the surface. TripA convinces the slaves to come with them and fight their way out through the mine they came from.  \n  \nDuring the battle many slaves lost their lives, some may or may not have reached the surface, TripA ends up falling into some kind of lair, escaping with the aid of a goblin, down a river and out through an underground structure in Threshia.","x":102,"y":3291,"width":398,"height":129},
		{"id":"963a65b6066842d6","type":"text","text":"**2999 EAD**\n\n  \n1 /2\n\n---\n\n##### Assault on Thornfield Castle\n\n**Military: Skirmish**\n\nMaking their way back to thornfield things have taken a turn for the worse, the elven district barricaded, and the forces in Thornfield Castle rallying around large machines with some air of the infernal about them.  \n  \nAfter starting a food riot, TripA investigate the tanks and while escaping; kidnap raz boughman, kill an innocent nun, steal one of the tanks, and kill a bunch of guards.  \n  \nLast seen headed south.","x":102,"y":3480,"width":398,"height":160},
		{"id":"2138863808deeb93","type":"text","text":"**2999 EAD**\n\n  \n3 /2\n\n---\n\n##### Arrival in Hommlet\n\n**Criminal Activity**\n\nTripA arrive in hommlet, leaving their tank hidden in the snow outside of town. Raz Boughman is flayed for information. The town is scouted, magic items are retrieved from the wizard tower, not much is learned or gained.","x":102,"y":3714,"width":398,"height":146},
		{"id":"6d5ac6d48e4b538b","type":"text","text":"**2999 EAD**\n\n  \n7 /2\n\n---\n\n##### Arrival in Blackthorn\n\n**Expedition**\n\nTripA arrive in Blackthorn after their tank's engine dies, they evade creatures south of town, drop down into the back of the settlement, witness a hung body, and make their way to the inn after disguising themselves. However, they attract attention by knocking over local statues and end up running quickly out of town before attracting more attention.","x":102,"y":3920,"width":398,"height":180},
		{"id":"fc6071bab52564f6","type":"text","text":"**2999 EAD**\n\n  \n9 /2\n\n---\n\n##### Arrival in Arborport\n\n**Expedition**\n\nTripA arrive in Arborport for the first time, via a potion merchant they attack/bribe and then steal from. They find a Tortle in the adventurers guild and grimtooth makes contacts at the thieves guild, a branch of the Five Finger Viscounts, before settling down in the Hermits Retreat for the night.","x":102,"y":4160,"width":398,"height":200},
		{"id":"251042f10cc4f429","type":"text","text":"**2999 EAD**\n\n  \n11 /2\n\n---\n\n##### Seeking Information in Arborport\n\n**Scientific achievement**\n\nTripA spend the day combing Arborport for information including the Minor Temple, Adventurers' Guild, Mages' Guild, the Waterfront and the Hermit's Retreat.  \nConsidered joining the adventurer's guild, attempted to bring Jod onto their team...","x":102,"y":4400,"width":398,"height":180},
		{"id":"6b52ba1fc9c01bb9","type":"text","text":"**2999 EAD**\n\n  \n19 /2\n\n---\n\n##### Solving the Fountain, fighting a narzugon\n\n**Life, Milestone**\n\nTripA spent some time figuring out the Fountain in Arborport. After a long night of shuffling stones, they found their way through a puzzle, into a wizard's study and out through another portal guarded by a fel creature.  \nFinding themselves back in arborport, but 9 days later, the team set off to light a magical candle they found in the wizard's study, and open a Gate (per the spell) into Avernus. Step through and come face to face with Devils galore in Ashdrift, hanging above the River Styx. And fought a Narzugon who pledged to inform Lady Zariel.","x":102,"y":4620,"width":398,"height":180},
		{"id":"3ab0e66f3ac2717d","type":"text","text":"- **-22 BAE**\n    \n      \n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Discovery of God's Tears\n    \n    **Discovery, Scientific**\n    \n- **-5 BAE**\n    \n      \n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Rise of the Spellweavers\n    \n    **Founding**\n    \n    The beginning of the rise of the Spellweavers, alternatively known as the Spellsmiths, the Arcanists.\n    \n    [read full story](https://www.worldanvil.com/w/arteria-adorath/h/21dff8eb-8d02-4153-97e6-a47a5984d263)\n    \n- **-1 BAE**\n    \n      \n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Collapse of the Elven Empire, Creation of Arteria\n    \n    **Revolution**\n    \n\n## Human Rule\n\n### 1 ASA and beyond\n\nThe age of humans, arcane magic, civilization, progress.\n\n- **1476 EAD**\n    \n      \n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### The sundering of the earth\n    \n    **Disaster / Destruction**\n    \n    The creation of the great rift.\n    \n- **2985 EAD**\n    \n      \n    17 /3\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### The tree is planted\n    \n    **Criminal Activity**\n    \n    The tree that creates the blight was planted in the East by the druids of the scythe.\n    \n- **2990 EAD**\n    \n      \n    15 /4\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Trees stop growing\n    \n    **Geological / environmental event**\n    \n    Ironwood and cloudleaf, really all the trees, stop reproducing at the rate that they had been.","x":-1360,"y":-720,"width":820,"height":1398},
		{"id":"5be6bf2f5f3a2786","type":"text","text":"- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    4 /10 06:00\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### The Players Leave Threshia\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    The players set out from Threshia with the Caravan led by Boren Stoutmantle.\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    7 /10 16:00\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### PCs arrive at RBO\n    \n    **Military action**\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    11 /10 08:00\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Players Leave Thornfield\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    Players leave Thornfield bound for Phandalin.\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    12 /10\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Battle with ankhegs\n    \n    **Military action**\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    14 /10\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### First Night in Phandalin\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    15 /10\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Night at the Fountain Near Phandalin\n    \n    **Celestial / Cosmic**\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    16 /10\n    \n    **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    18 /10\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### The Battle of Phandalin\n    \n    **Military action**\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    23 /10 900:00\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Back to Thornfield\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    26 /10\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Leaving Thornfield\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    The players leave Thornfield after a few days rest, helping the survivors of Phandalin, setting off to finish off the blight and kill a dragon.\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    29 /10\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Arrive in the Ruins of Phandalin\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    Players search the now burned and melted ruins of Phandalin, finding a basement full of climbing equipment and a map, with an x over the entrance to a mine, they decide to go there.\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    3 /11\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Night at the Ruins of a Foresters Camp\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    Explored the mine to the north, Ren disappeared, followed by Ali. 2 horses are gone, one dead one missing. Found a diary of a miner. On the way to the swamp.\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    10 /11\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Return to Thornfield\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    Leaving from Phandalin after parting from Minkmutt, Slaying the Dragon Gor'Korok and uprooting the Sunless Tree.\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    14 /11\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Arrival in Thornfield\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    Returning to Thornfield wielding Gor'Korok's skull.\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    17 /11\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Expedition South\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    AAA leaves Thornfield on the way south to investigate the troubles in Hommlet and the Iron Forest.\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    19 /11\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Leaving Hommlet\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    After selling the Goldfish to the wizard in the tower and investigating some strange activity.. AAA once again ventures south towards the Iron Forest.\n    \n- **2998 EAD**\n    \n      \n    25 /11\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Arrival in Laath Thalas\n    \n    **Discovery, Exploration**\n    \n    After a harrowing journey through the Iron Wood, where AAA encounter the giants Eznir and Fluag, an ancient tower crawling with undead, and get chased by an elvish scouting party over a bridge swarming with stirges, AAA eventually arrive in the elven cityt of Laath Thalas, home to the Spring Gleam druids.\n    \n- **2999 EAD**\n    \n      \n    16 /1\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Vespidans and Formians\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    AAA spend several weeks with the Elves, having learned of Aaracokra in service to a race of bee people, AAA travel south once more to investigate.  \n    After fighting a giant bear attempting to steal the bees' honey, AAA learn of a colony of Formians besieging the Vespidans. Knowing they are usually not so warlike the party approaches and attempts a parlay, when they are taken captive.\n    \n- **2999 EAD**\n    \n      \n    17 /1\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Thornfield becomes Vassal\n    \n    **Political event**\n    \n    AAA escape captivity in the formians hive through a portal found outside the queen's chambers. They emerge through a tower holding more than a few undead to find themselves in a Thornfield much different than the way they left it.\n    \n- **2999 EAD**\n    \n      \n    20 /1\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Triple A join the Cult of the Rift\n    \n    **Religious event**\n    \n    Triple A find themselves exploring the undercity of Thornfield. They split up, 2 joining a cult gaining momentum in Thornfield, hoping to gain a better understanding of their operations. The others follow behind. They are joined by Grimtooth Lowblow, to look for an ancient text.\n    \n- **2999 EAD**\n    \n      \n    22 /1\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Trident Valley Expedition\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    Triple A leave Thornfield under the control of Threshia Goldenmane and head north to the Arcanite mountains in search of a book, an artifact the Cult of the Rift is searching for.\n    \n- **2999 EAD**\n    \n      \n    24 /1\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### The Underdark\n    \n    **Disaster / Destruction**\n    \n    Triple A find themselves on the edges of the underdark after flooding the dungeon they were exploring with Lava. Encountering some escaped slaves from a nearby mine they join forces, go back to the mine and attempt a prison break.\n    \n- **2999 EAD**\n    \n      \n    27 /1\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Escape Through The Mine\n    \n    **Military action**\n    \n    Triple A travel through the underdark, before finding some escaped slaves looking for a way to the surface. TripA convinces the slaves to come with them and fight their way out through the mine they came from.  \n      \n    During the battle many slaves lost their lives, some may or may not have reached the surface, TripA ends up falling into some kind of lair, escaping with the aid of a goblin, down a river and out through an underground structure in Threshia.\n    \n- **2999 EAD**\n    \n      \n    1 /2\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Assault on Thornfield Castle\n    \n    **Military: Skirmish**\n    \n    Making their way back to thornfield things have taken a turn for the worse, the elven district barricaded, and the forces in Thornfield Castle rallying around large machines with some air of the infernal about them.  \n      \n    After starting a food riot, TripA investigate the tanks and while escaping; kidnap raz boughman, kill an innocent nun, steal one of the tanks, and kill a bunch of guards.  \n      \n    Last seen headed south.\n    \n- **2999 EAD**\n    \n      \n    3 /2\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Arrival in Hommlet\n    \n    **Criminal Activity**\n    \n    TripA arrive in hommlet, leaving their tank hidden in the snow outside of town. Raz Boughman is flayed for information. The town is scouted, magic items are retrieved from the wizard tower, not much is learned or gained.\n    \n- **2999 EAD**\n    \n      \n    7 /2\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Arrival in Blackthorn\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    TripA arrive in Blackthorn after their tank's engine dies, they evade creatures south of town, drop down into the back of the settlement, witness a hung body, and make their way to the inn after disguising themselves. However, they attract attention by knocking over local statues and end up running quickly out of town before attracting more attention.\n    \n- **2999 EAD**\n    \n      \n    9 /2\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Arrival in Arborport\n    \n    **Expedition**\n    \n    TripA arrive in Arborport for the first time, via a potion merchant they attack/bribe and then steal from. They find a Tortle in the adventurers guild and grimtooth makes contacts at the thieves guild, a branch of the Five Finger Viscounts, before settling down in the Hermits Retreat for the night.\n    \n- **2999 EAD**\n    \n      \n    11 /2\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Seeking Information in Arborport\n    \n    **Scientific achievement**\n    \n    TripA spend the day combing Arborport for information including the Minor Temple, Adventurers' Guild, Mages' Guild, the Waterfront and the Hermit's Retreat.  \n    Considered joining the adventurer's guild, attempted to bring Jod onto their team...\n    \n- **2999 EAD**\n    \n      \n    19 /2\n    \n    ---\n    \n    ##### Solving the Fountain, fighting a narzugon\n    \n    **Life, Milestone**\n    \n    TripA spent some time figuring out the Fountain in Arborport. After a long night of shuffling stones, they found their way through a puzzle, into a wizard's study and out through another portal guarded by a fel creature.  \n    Finding themselves back in arborport, but 9 days later, the team set off to light a magical candle they found in the wizard's study, and open a Gate (per the spell) into Avernus. Step through and come face to face with Devils galore in Ashdrift, hanging above the River Styx. And fought a Narzugon who pledged to inform Lady Zariel.","x":-1360,"y":940,"width":820,"height":4940}
	],
	"edges":[]
}